{"data": [{"author_id": "1521885555772071938", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:10:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119915450725527649"], "id": "2119915450725527649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 596, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119740524064322005", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Il est grv sournois cpelo va tfr enlécu par la bas stp https://t.co/LdqaO7P8kQ", "url": "https://x.com/xxdjs6/status/2119915450725527649"}, {"author_id": "2307737463", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:24:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119903941525913697"], "id": "2119903941525913697", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A WhatsApp group exclusively for $TFR holders is now live!\n\nhttps://t.co/aIS70woxIR\n\nAll investors who hold $TFR stock are welcome to join, discuss market trends, and stay up to date with the latest information.\n\nClick the link and send the number \"6\" to join.\n\n#Stocks", "url": "https://x.com/Raymondcole22/status/2119903941525913697"}, {"author_id": "1560401671288766469", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119924632690315708"], "id": "2119924632690315708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119725278079713729", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "TFR ahh scenario timeline https://t.co/k73LwUZLd3", "url": "https://x.com/AsgSomeguy/status/2119924632690315708"}, {"author_id": "1279835711345176576", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:08:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119900007897641198"], "id": "2119900007897641198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "tfr lobisini aternostan açmışlar aglıyoz", "url": "https://x.com/AFCfrederico/status/2119900007897641198"}, {"author_id": "1678184316881317890", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:47:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119924841125970359"], "id": "2119924841125970359", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 212, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119890651173023830", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Look at Appenzell-Innerrhoden and Appenzell-Ausserrhoden. It was split into Prot/Cath halves in 1597. Prot A-A did women's suffrage in 1972, but Cath A-I only in 1990.\n\n1. 1870-1990, A-I had ~1.0 higher TFR than A-A.\n\n2. Since 1990 women's suffrage, A-I TFR has dropped below A-A. https://t.co/YzZbmML9eA https://t.co/7IbXF7yV9W", "url": "https://x.com/SeamusNua/status/2119924841125970359"}, {"author_id": "2082544463138709504", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:10:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119930772526088563"], "id": "2119930772526088563", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119891542508802282", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Jv tjr kiffer ses esquives remises en sparring il m’hypnotise mais dsl poatan tu vas tfr nehess.. https://t.co/DllJ4IW28J", "url": "https://x.com/mome_sale07/status/2119930772526088563"}, {"author_id": "1889139639254151168", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:16:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119947169830666585"], "id": "2119947169830666585", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 642, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "もう2年経ったのか、懐かしぃ\n確かTFRが話題になってたのに誰も核兵器師団やってなかったからやったんだっけ、\nこの頃のTFRは愛国者戦線が強すぎて地獄だった https://t.co/Pa4HlgBisf", "url": "https://x.com/guderiblitz/status/2119947169830666585"}, {"author_id": "1194831908296953856", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:43:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet