https://t.co/ao4Ijt1mfg", "url": "https://x.com/CasseCool/status/2119936573265612933"}, {"author_id": "1099779768034172933", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:52:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119926187296510212"], "id": "2119926187296510212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What should you expect when considering egg freezing or fertility preservation?\n\nFrom Episode 37 of Empowered Wellness with Dr. Anita Lwanga, we discuss what women should know about the process and what to expect along the way.\n▶️https://t.co/hzfqRuteNu\n\n#EggFreezing #Fertility https://t.co/Q32twuYzIC", "url": "https://x.com/LwangaMD/status/2119926187296510212"}, {"author_id": "4043544432", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:23:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119949106756067433"], "id": "2119949106756067433", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119946613254938722", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I like to link concerns around declining fertility rates with the climate change of the effected geographical area because if fertility rates pick up, where are those future generations supposed to live?  Sea level rise will mean coastal areas will have to be abandoned by 2021. https://t.co/II1riEnT0O https://t.co/B2wxeQrcRX", "url": "https://x.com/suzanne_ralph/status/2119949106756067433"}, {"author_id": "1603464111312015361", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:36:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119906949135266019"], "id": "2119906949135266019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How much do you know about why your menstrual cycle changes throughout the month?\n\n📱 Start your FREE PeakDay trial: https://t.co/5towibxF0M\n🌸 Explore fertility and hormone health courses: https://t.co/o5AirGsHBY\n👉 Follow for more fertility tips https://t.co/VqsQob8ft3", "url": "https://x.com/PeakDayApp/status/2119906949135266019"}, {"author_id": "2072643631828107264", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:10:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119900570773578147"], "id": "2119900570773578147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Red-Blue Divide for Birth Rates,\n\nAn except from my upcoming book:\n\n\"Blue States Misopedism (“hate of children,” i.e., “If YOU Want A Family,” avoid!) \n\nMaybe Move? I’m not saying don’t go to Harvard (I once had a summer research fellowship for its Washington Research Campus,", "url": "https://x.com/DrAndrewPorter1/status/2119900570773578147"}, {"author_id": "16859939", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:57:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119912218729009225"], "id": "2119912218729009225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Sputtering Ignition: The  Collapse of the 'Muslim Fertility Engine'\n\nFor decades, a dominant demographic narrative predicted that skyrocketing birth rates in Muslim-majority nations would fundamentally reshape the global landscape. But new data reveals a shocking reality: that", "url": "https://x.com/CotoBlogzz/status/2119912218729009225"}, {"author_id": "812483833", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:48:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119909990618317105"], "id": "2119909990618317105", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 125, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "built like an ancient fertility goddess ✨ https://t.co/Kmfkur2qpQ", "url": "https://x.com/PUBERTY_3/status/2119909990618317105"}, {"author_id": "743511204107292672", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:49:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet